    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Microorganism Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "A genus of single-stranded, positive-sense RNA viruses in the family coronaviridae. The alphacoronavirus envelope contains glycoprotein trimers that project outward." ;
