    flat:definition "An electrocardiographic tracing demonstrating sinus bradycardia, with a heart rate lower than an acceptable, predetermined threshold.  Different thresholds, for rate and/or duration, may apply to different patient populations." ;
    flat:parents "C111097" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Finding" ;
    flat:synonyms "Marked Sinus Bradycardia by ECG Finding|MARKED SINUS BRADYCARDIA" ;
