    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Microorganism Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "Subgroup 2 of Legionella pneumophila, differentiated by its antigenicity. Although this serogroup is rarely identified in infected individuals it causes clinical features similar to the pneumonia caused by other serogroups." ;
    flat:parents "C86489" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Bacterium" ;
    flat:synonyms "Legionella pneumophila Serogroup 2|LEGIONELLA PNEUMOPHILA SEROGROUP 2" ;
.

