    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Microorganism Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "A species of parasitic trypanosomatid protozoa in the family Trypanosomatidae. L. infantum is the causative agent of infantile visceral leishmaniasis in the Mediterranean region and in Latin America." ;
    flat:parents "C123421" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Eukaryote" ;
    flat:synonyms "Leishmania infantum|LEISHMANIA INFANTUM|Leishmania chagasi|Leishmania donovani infantum" ;
.

ncit:C12351
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/ncit-flat#Thesaurus> ;
    flat:code "C12351" ;
    flat:concept%20IRI "<http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C12351>" ;
    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Anatomical Location Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|CDISC SEND Biospecimens Terminology|CDISC SEND Microscopic Findings Result Modifier Terminology|CDISC SEND Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology|GDC Terminology|GDC Value Terminology|Mapped ICDO3.1 Terminology|Mapped ICDO3.1 Topography PT Terminology|Mapped ICDO3.1 Topography Terminology|Mapped ICDO3.2 Terminology|Mapped ICDO3.2 Topography PT Terminology|Mapped ICDO3.2 Topography Terminology|mCode Radiotherapy Treatment Location Value Set|mCode Terminology|UBERON Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "The part of the brain that controls muscle functions and also controls speech, thought, emotions, reading, writing, and learning. The right hemisphere controls the muscles on the left side of the body, and the left hemisphere controls the muscles on the right side of the body." ;
    flat:display%20name "Cerebral Hemispheres" ;
    flat:parents "C13031" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Body Part, Organ, or Organ Component" ;
    flat:synonyms "Cerebral Hemisphere|BRAIN, CEREBRUM|BRAIN, CEREBRUM|Brain Hemisphere|Brain, Cerebrum|CEREBRUM|Cerebral|Cerebral Hemispheres|Cerebral hemisphere structure (body structure)|Cerebrum|Cerebrum|Cerebrum|Structure of cerebrum (body structure)|cerebral hemisphere|cerebral hemisphere|cerebrum" ;
.

