    flat:definition "One of the lobes of the cerebral hemisphere located superiorly to the occipital lobe and posteriorly to the frontal lobe. Cognition and visuospatial processing are its main functions." ;
    flat:display%20name "Parietal Lobe" ;
    flat:parents "C13031" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Body Part, Organ, or Organ Component" ;
