    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Microorganism Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "A genus of fungi in the family Piedraiaceae. Species in this genus are generally nonpathogenic but may cause opportunistic infection of hair shafts in humans." ;
    flat:parents "C77167" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Fungus" ;
    flat:synonyms "Piedraia|PIEDRAIA" ;
.

