    flat:definition "The lower portion of the brainstem located between the pons and the spinal cord. This structure contains several descending and ascending tracts, lower cranial nerve nuclei, a significant proportion of the reticular system of the brainstem and other structures." ;
    flat:display%20name "Medulla Oblongata" ;
