    flat:definition "A questionnaire developed by the European Organisation for Research and Treatment of Cancer (EORTC) consisting of 26 questions designed to assess pain, dietary changes, jaundice, altered bowel habit, emotional problems related to pancreatic cancer, and other symptoms (cachexia, indigestion, flatulence, dry mouth, taste changes)." ;
