    flat:concept%20IRI "<http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C127302>" ;
    flat:definition "A genus of yeast-like fungi in the phylum Basidiomycota with arthroconidia developing from disarticulate hyphae. Species in this genus are positive for urease and diazonium blue B. Sexual reproduction is not observed." ;
