    flat:concept%20IRI "<http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C127305>" ;
    flat:definition "A genus of fungi in the phylum Ascomycota that includes those that cause tinea, athlete's foot, ringworm, and jock itch. Species in this genus are molds, characterized by the development of smooth-walled macro- and microconidia." ;
