    flat:code "C128548" ;
    flat:concept%20IRI "<http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C128548>" ;
    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Microorganism Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "A species of facultative anaerobic, Gram-positive, nonmotile, nonspore-forming, coccus-shaped bacteria in the phylum Firmicutes. This species is coagulase-negative and is a commensal organism on the skin of healthy humans but may cause infections in immunocompromised individuals." ;
