    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Terminology|CDISC SDTM Tumor Response Result Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "A minimum 20% increase and minimum 5 mm absolute increase in total measured tumor burden compared to nadir, or irPD for non-target or new non-measurable lesions. Confirmation of progression is recommended minimum 4 weeks after the first irPD assessment." ;
