    flat:semantic%20type "Laboratory Procedure" ;
    flat:synonyms "Micro-Latex Particle-Mediated Immunoassay|Latex Agglutination|Latex Fixation|MICRO-LATEX PARTICLE-MEDIATED IMMUNOASSAY" ;
.

