    flat:definition "A method for estimating body surface area, in which the individual's palm, excluding fingers and wrist, accounts for about 0.5% of the total body surface area of that individual. The entire palmar surface (including fingers) accounts for about 1% of the individuals total body surface area." ;
    flat:parents "C68645" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Occupational Activity" ;
    flat:synonyms "Palm Method|PALM METHOD" ;
.

