    flat:definition "A six-item self-administered questionnaire, developed by Gater et al. in 2016, that utilizes a ten-point rating scale to assess a patient's experience with core asthma symptoms during the preceding day, including difficulty breathing, wheezing, shortness of breath, chest tightness, chest pain, and cough." ;
