    flat:definition "A formula to calculate the glucose management indicator (GMI) as a percentage. GMI = 3.31 + 0.02392 x [mean glucose in mg/dL]. (Richard M. Bergenstal, Roy W. Beck, Kelly L. Close, et al. Glucose Management Indicator (GMI): A New Term for Estimating A1C From Continuous Glucose Monitoring. Diabetes Care 2018 Nov; 41(11): 2275-2280.)" ;
    flat:parents "C19044" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Quantitative Concept" ;
    flat:synonyms "Glucose Management Indicator Percentage Formula|GMI % FORMULA|Glucose Management Indicator % Formula" ;
.

