    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Laboratory Analytical Method Calculation Formula Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "A formula to calculate the glucose management indicator (GMI) in mmol/mol. GMI = 12.71 + 4.70587 x [mean glucose in mmol/L]. (Richard M. Bergenstal, Roy W. Beck, Kelly L. Close, et al. Glucose Management Indicator (GMI): A New Term for Estimating A1C From Continuous Glucose Monitoring. Diabetes Care 2018 Nov; 41(11): 2275-2280.)" ;
    flat:parents "C19044" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Quantitative Concept" ;
    flat:synonyms "Glucose Management Indicator Mmol/mol Formula|GMI MMOL/MOL FORMULA|Glucose Management Indicator mmol/mol Formula" ;
.

