    flat:semantic%20type "Intellectual Product" ;
    flat:synonyms "European Organization for the Research and Treatment of Cancer Quality of Life Questionnaire - Elderly Cancer Patients 14 Items|EOR08|EORTC QLQ-ELD14|EORTC QLQ-ELD14" ;
.

