    flat:synonyms "Cumulative Illness Rating Scale for Geriatrics Clinical Classification|CIRS-G|CIRS-G|CIRS-G|CIRSG1|Cumulative Illness Rating Scale for Geriatrics|Cumulative Illness Rating Scale for Geriatrics (CIRS-G)" ;
.

