    flat:definition "A standardized self-report questionnaire, derived from the Patient Health Questionnaire-9 items and published in 2002, that includes nine items from the diagnostic criteria for MDD in the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, Fourth Edition (DSM-IV) and is used to measure depression severity." ;
    flat:parents "C91105" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Intellectual Product" ;
    flat:synonyms "The Patient Health Questionnaire - 8 Item|PHQ-8|PHQ-8|PHQ05" ;
.

