    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Binding Agent for Immunogenicity Tests Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|CDISC SEND Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "Antigen(s) of the extractable nuclear RNA-binding proteins that may be comprised of (but not limited to) Smith B, B', N, D1, D2, D3, E, F and G. They are commonly associated with the autoimmune disease systemic lupus erythematosus." ;
    flat:parents "C198225" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Amino Acid, Peptide, or Protein|Immunologic Factor" ;
    flat:synonyms "Smith Antigen|SMITH ANTIGENS|Smith Autoantigens|Smith Autoantigens" ;
.

