    flat:synonyms "Canadian Cardiovascular Society Grading of Angina Pectoris Clinical Classification|CANADIAN CV SOCIETY GRADING ANGINA|CCS Angina Classification|CCS Grading of Angina Pectoris|CCSGA1" ;
.

