    flat:synonyms "Microtubule-Associated Protein 1B|MAP-1B|MAP1B|MAP1B|MAP5|Microtubule Associated Protein 1B|Microtubule Associated Protein 1B|PCA-2 Antigen|PURKINJE CELL CYTOPLASMIC TYPE 2 ANTIGEN" ;
