    flat:definition "The approximately 67 kDa membrane fusion glycoprotein encoded by the vesicular stomatitis Indiana virus VSIVgp4 (G) gene that enables viral-host receptor recognition and binding." ;
    flat:parents "C16610" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Amino Acid, Peptide, or Protein" ;
