    flat:concept%20in%20subset "CDISC SDTM Binding Agent for Immunogenicity Tests Terminology|CDISC SDTM Terminology|CDISC SEND Terminology|Clinical Data Interchange Standards Consortium Terminology" ;
    flat:definition "The type B receptor in the GABA receptor family that binds to and mediates the neurotransmission of gamma-aminobutyric acid. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with the autoimmune disease limbic encephalitis." ;
