    flat:semantic%20type "Amino Acid, Peptide, or Protein|Receptor" ;
    flat:synonyms "Gamma Aminobutyrate B Receptor|GABAB Receptor|GABABR|GAMMA AMINOBUTYRATE B RECEPTOR|Gamma-Aminobutyric Acid B Receptor|Gamma-Aminobutyric Acid Receptor Complex|Gamma-Aminobutyric Acid Type B Receptor|Gamma-aminobutyric Acid B Receptor" ;
.

