    flat:definition "Administration of a drug within the eye. Intraocular drugs are almost always used for their local effects." ;
    flat:parents "C38114" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Functional Concept" ;
    flat:synonyms "Intraocular Route of Administration|I-OCUL|I-OCUL|INTRAOCULAR|INTRAOCULAR|INTRAOCULAR|Intraocular|Intraocular|Intraocular use" ;
.

