    flat:definition "The administration of a drug within or into a vein or veins over a sustained period of time. A slow, continuous drip avoids excessively high transient peak plasma levels." ;
    flat:parents "C38276" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Functional Concept" ;
    flat:synonyms "Intravenous Drip|INTRAVENOUS DRIP|INTRAVENOUS DRIP|INTRAVENOUS DRIP|IV DRIP|IV Drip" ;
.

