    flat:definition "One Kallikrein Inhibitor Unit is identical to the quantity of protease inhibitor (eg, aprotinin) that has the ability to inhibit two kallikrein units by 50% under optimal conditions. One Kallikrein Inhibitor Unit is equal to 0.025 antiplasmin units or 0.0031 trypsin inhibitor units." ;
