    flat:definition "A grouping of individuals on the basis of a shared procedure or disease, or lack thereof (e.g. healthy volunteers, type 2 diabetic subjects, subjects with renal cell cancer).  Standardized naming systems are available that define the groups within which a subject should be placed." ;
    flat:parents "C199141" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Functional Concept" ;
    flat:synonyms "Diagnosis Group|TDIGRP" ;
.

