    flat:semantic%20type "Laboratory Procedure" ;
    flat:synonyms "Erythrocyte Distribution Width Measurement|Erythrocytes Distribution Width|Erythrocytes Distribution Width|RDW|RDW-CV|Red Blood Cell Distribution Width|Red Cell Volume Distribution Width" ;
.

