    flat:definition "Any substance found in the diet, comprising a cholestane skeleton with a hydroxyl group at the position C-3. They occur naturally in plants, animals and fungi." ;
    flat:parents "C68341" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Organic Chemical" ;
    flat:synonyms "Dietary Sterol" ;
.

