    flat:definition "An electrocardiographic finding of a junctional rhythm with a heat rate which is abnormally low. (CDISC)" ;
    flat:parents "C80503" ;
    flat:semantic%20type "Finding" ;
    flat:synonyms "Junctional Bradycardia by ECG Finding|JUNCTIONAL BRADYCARDIA|Junctional Bradycardia|Junctional Bradycardia by EKG Finding|Junctional bradycardia" ;
.

